1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,230
She invested $24,000. He invested $72,000. She retired richer.

2
00:00:06,330 --> 00:00:11,950
Emma saves $200 a month from age 25 to 35. Then stops. Forever.

3
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:18,230
Jake starts at 35. $200 a month, for 30 years.

4
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:19,670
Same 8% return.

5
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:22,660
At 65, Jake has $294,000.

6
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:26,040
Emma? $378,000.

7
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:28,370
Her money just had ten more years to grow.

8
00:00:28,470 --> 00:00:30,390
So… which one are you?
